{"ts": 0.197969, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 4 — GATE TASK\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nWork inside \u001b[94m/var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-5p9jk680/stage4\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\nDo these:\r\n\r\n  1. Use \u001b[92mseq\u001b[0m and a pipe to count from 1 to 100 and save\r\n     the count to \u001b[94mcount.txt\u001b[0m.\r\n     \u001b[90m(hint: \u001b[92mseq 1 100 | wc -l > count.txt\u001b[0m\u001b[90m)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  2. Use a glob to list every \u001b[94m*.txt\u001b[0m file in this folder.\r\n\r\nThen type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mI will check: count.txt exists and contains 100.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m when done.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 538}
{"ts": 0.198382, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
